<p>Determines how requests arriving on a different host name for this page will be redirected:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>None:</strong> No redirection occurs based on host name override.</li>
<li><strong>301:</strong> Requests are permanently redirected to the override host name.</li>
<li><strong>302:</strong> Requests are temporarily redirected to the override host name.</li>
</ul>
